('conflict.v0180.hoitsu_object_gap','modern_work.japan.hoitsu_wind_thunder_version','japan.wind_thunder.hoitsu_catalogue','claim.v0180.hoitsu_created','claim.v0180.network_hoitsu','CATALOGUE_GAP','OPEN','Museum scholarship confirms a Hōitsu version, while an exact object-level holding institution and catalogue number are not yet attached.','Replace the work-level record with or link it to a museum object only after an official catalogue match.');

